      "details": "<p>The Helsinki Atlas location follows earlier proposals that identify Kisuatni as Karah\u00fcy\u00fck, which is ca. 15 km south of Torakkale. Despite displaying\u00a0<span>Kisuatni (Kissuwatna) on Map 2, the Helsinki Atlas regards the certainty of that place as\u00a0</span>category \"4\" (conjectural or speculative).</p>",
